    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "THREE-BEDROOM SEMI-DETACHED PROPERTY, IN AN EXCELLENT LOCATION, JUST A FEW MINUTES’ WALK FROM LONGFORD TOWN CENTRE.\r\n\r\nNo. 56 Farneyhoogan is situated in the heart of Longford Town, a short stroll from the train and bus station, while Longford Cathedral is less than ten-minute walk away. This property would make a perfect owner occupier home, or indeed as an investment property, with Lidl & Dunnes supermarkets, Hanlons service station and Applegreen just 300m away.\r\n\r\nThis well located property, which is in need of repair and renovations throughout, has huge potential. The accommodation consists of a sitting room, kitchen/dining room, three bedrooms and a family bathroom room. \r\n\r\nPlease contact us on 043 3350555 to arrange your viewing, or call to us at 53 Main Street, Longford.\r\n\r\nEIRCODE: N39 E3C9"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Sitting Room: 3.55m x 4.25m\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room: 3.15m x 5.40m\r\n\r\nBed 1: 3.50m x 3.10m\r\n\r\nBed 2: 2.90m x 4.30m\r\n\r\nBed 3: 2.55m x 2.80m\r\n\r\nBathroom: 1.90m x 1.85m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Pvc windows and doors\r\n\r\nOff street parking\r\n\r\n5-minute walk to the Train & Bus Station\r\n\r\nNational & Secondary Schools- few minutes’ walk\r\n\r\nWheelie bin access to the rear \r\n\r\nLess than a 10-minute walk to the Cathedral, Lidl, Dunnes Stores & Applegreen\r\n\r\nLongford Golf Club and Back Stage Theatre are within walking distance\r\n\r\n5 minute walk to Longford Town Centre & shopping mall\r\n\r\nMains Water and sewerage"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      }
